"default": "Taking wisdom and lessons from 18 years of therapy and paying it forward with radical transparency,
vulnerability, and education."
},
{
"type": "textarea",
"id": "left_text_2",
"label": "Left paragraph 2",
"default": "It is my hope that you finally feel safe to show up as the fullest you, and that in doing so you learn to
radically love and accept others in their full self-states, too."
},
{
"type": "textarea",
"id": "highlight_text",
